\par
A 2(judgment type) x 3(response category) ANOVA demonstrated no main effect of
\par
judgment type, \emph{F}(1,32) = 1.93, \emph{p} = .17; a significant main effect of response category,
\par
\emph{F}(1.38,44.24) = 38.97, \emph{p} {$<$} .001; and no interaction between the two, \emph{F}(1.53,48.88) = 1.06, \emph{p} =
\par
.35. Separate 3(response category) ANOVAs for confidence judgments and subjective
