The R2 of corporate environmental innovativeness
\par
and adaptability is 70 percent and 57 percent, respec-
\par
tively, indicating significant data variation explained
\par
by EII. Similarly, environmental management capabil-
\par
ities explain 24 percent of financial performance and
\par
55 percent of environmental performance. The results
\par
indicate that supplier EII does not affect environmen-
\par
tal innovativeness (b= 0.13, p {$>$} 0.05) and adaptabil-
\par
