Wu et al. [2012] attempted to infuse human-like curiosity into a virtual companion
\par
to detect potentially interesting learning objects for users and help them avoid the
\par
feeling of being lost in virtual world based learning environments. Their model is built
\par
based on Berlyne's theory and considers four collative variables that can stimulate
\par
