4 Discussion
\par
Our case study illustrates the impact of two evidence-
\par
synthesis paradigms, PMA as a conventional evidence-
\par
meta-analysis (PMA) or network meta-analysis (NMA). Only treat-
\par
ment comparisons with highest EVPI were plotted. ICS inhaled
\par
