\par
CM at failure. For example, if we consider the standard minimal
\par
repair case, then we have a component that is repaired minimally
\par
(ABAO) upon failure (with negligible repair duration) and replaced
\par
at critical age T. In this case, the random process over interval {$\frac{1}{2}$}0,T
\par
is a non-homogeneous Poisson process, and we have
